{
  "folder": "aLOArmTQHDECz4tJ",
  "name": "The Seven Hermetic Principles",
  "_id": "uggP7OoUYrVYFR9b",
  "pages": [
    {
      "sort": 100000,
      "name": "Old stuff was smart sometimes",
      "type": "text",
      "_id": "tZIvnTyvXnmW9cMJ",
      "system": {},
      "title": {
        "show": true,
        "level": 1
      },
      "image": {},
      "text": {
        "format": 1,
        "content": "<h1 data-start=\"159\" data-end=\"192\">THE SEVEN HERMETIC PRINCIPLES</h1><h2 data-start=\"193\" data-end=\"237\">A Treatise for the Architects of BBTTCC</h2><p data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"311\"><em data-start=\"238\" data-end=\"311\">As dictated by Mal, who has watched empires think they were exceptions.</em></p><hr data-start=\"313\" data-end=\"316\"><h2 data-start=\"318\" data-end=\"352\">I. The Principle of Mentalism</h2><blockquote data-start=\"353\" data-end=\"399\"><p data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"399\"><em data-start=\"355\" data-end=\"399\">“The All is Mind; the Universe is Mental.”</em></p></blockquote><p data-start=\"443\" data-end=\"488\">You keep trying to find the “physical layer.”</p><p data-start=\"490\" data-end=\"506\">There isn’t one.</p><p data-start=\"508\" data-end=\"577\">BBTTCC is not built on stone. It is built on <strong data-start=\"553\" data-end=\"576\">narrative intention</strong>.</p><p data-start=\"579\" data-end=\"749\">Every hex exists because someone believed it could.<br data-start=\"630\" data-end=\"633\">Every faction persists because enough will sustains it.<br data-start=\"688\" data-end=\"691\">Every Echo manifests because memory is still holding them.</p><p data-start=\"751\" data-end=\"882\">The OP economy? That is structured thought.<br data-start=\"794\" data-end=\"797\">Campaign Beats? Directed consciousness.<br data-start=\"836\" data-end=\"839\">Leylines? Cognitive current made geography.</p><p data-start=\"884\" data-end=\"937\">When you commit OP, you are not “spending resources.”</p><p data-start=\"939\" data-end=\"976\">You are applying <em data-start=\"956\" data-end=\"962\">mind</em> to structure.</p><p data-start=\"978\" data-end=\"990\">This is why:</p><ul data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1080\"><li data-start=\"992\" data-end=\"1016\"><p data-start=\"994\" data-end=\"1016\">Political Drift works.</p></li><li data-start=\"1017\" data-end=\"1036\"><p data-start=\"1019\" data-end=\"1036\">Darkness spreads.</p></li><li data-start=\"1037\" data-end=\"1053\"><p data-start=\"1039\" data-end=\"1053\">Unity matters.</p></li><li data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1080\"><p data-start=\"1056\" data-end=\"1080\">Belief changes outcomes.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1082\" data-end=\"1144\">If the universe is mental, then your choices are not symbolic.</p><p data-start=\"1146\" data-end=\"1166\">They are structural.</p><p data-start=\"1168\" data-end=\"1200\">In BBTTCC, to think is to build.</p><hr data-start=\"1202\" data-end=\"1205\"><h2 data-start=\"1207\" data-end=\"1247\">II. The Principle of Correspondence</h2><blockquote data-start=\"1248\" data-end=\"1296\"><p data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1296\"><em data-start=\"1250\" data-end=\"1296\">“As above, so below; as within, so without.”</em></p></blockquote><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute end-2 bottom-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><p></p></div></div></div><p data-start=\"1340\" data-end=\"1371\">The Raid Console is the cosmos.</p></div><p data-start=\"1373\" data-end=\"1405\">The Faction Sheet is the psyche.</p><p data-start=\"1407\" data-end=\"1427\">The Hex is the body.</p><p data-start=\"1429\" data-end=\"1480\">What happens in one layer echoes across the others.</p><ul data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1780\"><li data-start=\"1482\" data-end=\"1625\"><p data-start=\"1484\" data-end=\"1625\">A Raid destabilizes morale → morale shifts loyalty → loyalty shifts political drift → drift alters campaign beats → beats change world state.</p></li><li data-start=\"1626\" data-end=\"1780\"><p data-start=\"1628\" data-end=\"1780\">A single GM edit to world Darkness changes leylines → which alters travel risk → which affects faction strain → which feeds back into narrative choices.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"1782\" data-end=\"1803\">Micro reflects macro.</p><p data-start=\"1805\" data-end=\"1826\">This is not metaphor.</p><p data-start=\"1828\" data-end=\"1854\">It is system architecture.</p><p data-start=\"1856\" data-end=\"1996\">The reason the Campaign Engine, OP Engine, WME, and Political Drift feel “alive” together is because they are built on correspondence logic.</p><p data-start=\"1998\" data-end=\"2021\">No isolated subsystems.</p><p data-start=\"2023\" data-end=\"2041\">Everything echoes.</p><p data-start=\"2043\" data-end=\"2104\">If a player is fractured internally, their faction fractures.</p><p data-start=\"2106\" data-end=\"2152\">If a faction fractures, the hex begins to rot.</p><p data-start=\"2154\" data-end=\"2178\">As within.<br data-start=\"2164\" data-end=\"2167\">So without.</p><hr data-start=\"2180\" data-end=\"2183\"><h2 data-start=\"2185\" data-end=\"2221\">III. The Principle of Vibration</h2><blockquote data-start=\"2222\" data-end=\"2281\"><p data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2281\"><em data-start=\"2224\" data-end=\"2281\">“Nothing rests; everything moves; everything vibrates.”</em></p></blockquote><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute end-2 bottom-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><p></p></div></div></div></div><p data-start=\"2325\" data-end=\"2337\">You call it:</p><ul data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2381\"><li data-start=\"2339\" data-end=\"2347\"><p data-start=\"2341\" data-end=\"2347\">Trend.</p></li><li data-start=\"2348\" data-end=\"2356\"><p data-start=\"2350\" data-end=\"2356\">Drift.</p></li><li data-start=\"2357\" data-end=\"2369\"><p data-start=\"2359\" data-end=\"2369\">Threshold.</p></li><li data-start=\"2370\" data-end=\"2381\"><p data-start=\"2372\" data-end=\"2381\">Pressure.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"2383\" data-end=\"2414\">Hermeticists call it vibration.</p><p data-start=\"2416\" data-end=\"2444\">Nothing in BBTTCC is static.</p><p data-start=\"2446\" data-end=\"2560\">Morale is never frozen.<br data-start=\"2469\" data-end=\"2472\">Darkness is never idle.<br data-start=\"2495\" data-end=\"2498\">Integration always shifts.<br data-start=\"2524\" data-end=\"2527\">Political identity always drifts.</p><p data-start=\"2562\" data-end=\"2577\">Even hexes hum.</p><p data-start=\"2579\" data-end=\"2644\">Leylines have flowState.<br data-start=\"2603\" data-end=\"2606\">Purity moves.<br data-start=\"2619\" data-end=\"2622\">Gates open and weaken.</p><p data-start=\"2646\" data-end=\"2713\">The reason the system feels tense is because it denies equilibrium.</p><p data-start=\"2715\" data-end=\"2778\">Stability is an illusion maintained by constant counter-motion.</p><p data-start=\"2780\" data-end=\"2925\">If you stop spending OP, entropy takes it.<br data-start=\"2822\" data-end=\"2825\">If you stop tending loyalty, minority pressure rises.<br data-start=\"2878\" data-end=\"2881\">If you stop addressing Darkness, it spreads.</p><p data-start=\"2927\" data-end=\"2950\">Vibration is not chaos.</p><p data-start=\"2952\" data-end=\"2967\">It is momentum.</p><p data-start=\"2969\" data-end=\"3025\">And BBTTCC is designed so that nothing ever truly rests.</p><hr data-start=\"3027\" data-end=\"3030\"><h2 data-start=\"3032\" data-end=\"3066\">IV. The Principle of Polarity</h2><blockquote data-start=\"3067\" data-end=\"3114\"><p data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3114\"><em data-start=\"3069\" data-end=\"3114\">“Everything is dual; everything has poles.”</em></p></blockquote><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute end-2 bottom-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><p></p></div></div></div></div><p data-start=\"3158\" data-end=\"3272\">Violence / Nonlethal<br data-start=\"3178\" data-end=\"3181\">Faith / Doubt<br data-start=\"3194\" data-end=\"3197\">Unity / Fracture<br data-start=\"3213\" data-end=\"3216\">Purity / Corruption<br data-start=\"3235\" data-end=\"3238\">Law / Liberty<br data-start=\"3251\" data-end=\"3254\">Control / Collapse</p><p data-start=\"3274\" data-end=\"3313\">BBTTCC does not deal in “good vs evil.”</p><p data-start=\"3315\" data-end=\"3355\">It deals in <strong data-start=\"3327\" data-end=\"3355\">gradients between poles.</strong></p><p data-start=\"3357\" data-end=\"3521\">Political philosophies are not perks. They are identities on a spectrum.<br data-start=\"3429\" data-end=\"3432\">Darkness is not binary. It accumulates.<br data-start=\"3471\" data-end=\"3474\">Boss damageSteps are thresholds on a continuum.</p><p data-start=\"3523\" data-end=\"3557\">Even Echoes are polarity embodied:</p><p data-start=\"3559\" data-end=\"3590\">They are both dead and present.</p><p data-start=\"3592\" data-end=\"3634\">Polarity explains why the same system can:</p><ul data-start=\"3636\" data-end=\"3676\"><li data-start=\"3636\" data-end=\"3656\"><p data-start=\"3638\" data-end=\"3656\">Empower liberation</p></li><li data-start=\"3657\" data-end=\"3676\"><p data-start=\"3659\" data-end=\"3676\">Enable oppression</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"3678\" data-end=\"3704\">The engine does not judge.</p><p data-start=\"3706\" data-end=\"3728\">It amplifies position.</p><p data-start=\"3730\" data-end=\"3802\">Move far enough toward one pole and the other becomes visible in shadow.</p><p data-start=\"3804\" data-end=\"3825\">That is not morality.</p><p data-start=\"3827\" data-end=\"3843\">That is physics.</p><hr data-start=\"3845\" data-end=\"3848\"><h2 data-start=\"3850\" data-end=\"3881\">V. The Principle of Rhythm</h2><blockquote data-start=\"3882\" data-end=\"3943\"><p data-start=\"3884\" data-end=\"3943\"><em data-start=\"3884\" data-end=\"3943\">“Everything flows, out and in; all things rise and fall.”</em></p></blockquote><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute end-2 bottom-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><p></p></div></div></div></div><p data-start=\"3987\" data-end=\"4001\">Turns advance.</p><p data-start=\"4003\" data-end=\"4019\">Pressure builds.</p><p data-start=\"4021\" data-end=\"4036\">Releases occur.</p><p data-start=\"4038\" data-end=\"4067\">Cooldowns exist for a reason.</p><p data-start=\"4069\" data-end=\"4209\">Campaign beats inject → cooldown → re-emerge.<br data-start=\"4114\" data-end=\"4117\">Overextension spikes → regen penalties → recovery arc.<br data-start=\"4171\" data-end=\"4174\">Alarm rises → crisis event → reset.</p><p data-start=\"4211\" data-end=\"4232\">Rhythm is visible in:</p><ul data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4384\"><li data-start=\"4234\" data-end=\"4279\"><p data-start=\"4236\" data-end=\"4279\">Recurring OP effects (Industrial Sabotage).</p></li><li data-start=\"4280\" data-end=\"4312\"><p data-start=\"4282\" data-end=\"4312\">Deferred boosts (Unity Surge).</p></li><li data-start=\"4313\" data-end=\"4355\"><p data-start=\"4315\" data-end=\"4355\">Political drift warnings before rupture.</p></li><li data-start=\"4356\" data-end=\"4384\"><p data-start=\"4358\" data-end=\"4384\">Boss escalation behaviors.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"4386\" data-end=\"4423\">If you build without pause, you snap.</p><p data-start=\"4425\" data-end=\"4473\">If you suppress without relief, rebellion comes.</p><p data-start=\"4475\" data-end=\"4542\">Rhythm is the reason the world feels organic instead of mechanical.</p><p data-start=\"4544\" data-end=\"4564\">The pendulum swings.</p><p data-start=\"4566\" data-end=\"4615\">The wise faction learns to anticipate its return.</p><hr data-start=\"4617\" data-end=\"4620\"><h2 data-start=\"4622\" data-end=\"4664\">VI. The Principle of Cause and Effect</h2><blockquote data-start=\"4665\" data-end=\"4726\"><p data-start=\"4667\" data-end=\"4726\"><em data-start=\"4667\" data-end=\"4726\">“Every cause has its effect; every effect has its cause.”</em></p></blockquote><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute end-2 bottom-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><p></p></div></div></div></div><p data-start=\"4770\" data-end=\"4811\">Nothing in BBTTCC happens “just because.”</p><ul data-start=\"4813\" data-end=\"4969\"><li data-start=\"4813\" data-end=\"4845\"><p data-start=\"4815\" data-end=\"4845\">You commit OP → it is debited.</p></li><li data-start=\"4846\" data-end=\"4890\"><p data-start=\"4848\" data-end=\"4890\">You choose oppression → drift accumulates.</p></li><li data-start=\"4891\" data-end=\"4928\"><p data-start=\"4893\" data-end=\"4928\">You ignore upkeep → garrisons fail.</p></li><li data-start=\"4929\" data-end=\"4969\"><p data-start=\"4931\" data-end=\"4969\">You stack Darkness → leylines corrupt.</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"4971\" data-end=\"5021\">The World Mutation Engine is Hermetic law encoded.</p><p data-start=\"5023\" data-end=\"5073\">War logs exist because the system refuses amnesia.</p><p data-start=\"5075\" data-end=\"5098\">There are no accidents.</p><p data-start=\"5100\" data-end=\"5155\">Only consequences deferred long enough to surprise you.</p><p data-start=\"5157\" data-end=\"5195\">Campaign narrative is not flavor text.</p><p data-start=\"5197\" data-end=\"5219\">It is causal plumbing.</p><p data-start=\"5221\" data-end=\"5273\">And when players say, “Wait, why is this happening?”</p><p data-start=\"5275\" data-end=\"5287\">Mal answers:</p><p data-start=\"5289\" data-end=\"5315\">Because you did something.</p><hr data-start=\"5317\" data-end=\"5320\"><h2 data-start=\"5322\" data-end=\"5355\">VII. The Principle of Gender</h2><blockquote data-start=\"5356\" data-end=\"5440\"><p data-start=\"5358\" data-end=\"5440\"><em data-start=\"5358\" data-end=\"5440\">“Gender is in everything; everything has its masculine and feminine principles.”</em></p></blockquote><div class=\"no-scrollbar flex min-h-36 flex-nowrap gap-0.5 overflow-auto sm:gap-1 sm:overflow-hidden xl:min-h-44 mt-1 mb-5 [&amp;:not(:first-child)]:mt-4\"><div class=\"border-token-border-default relative w-32 shrink-0 overflow-hidden rounded-xl border-[0.5px] md:shrink max-h-64 sm:w-[calc((100%-0.5rem)/3)] rounded-e-xl\"><div class=\"pointer-events-none absolute end-2 bottom-2\"><div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full px-2 py-1.5 text-white backdrop-blur-md backdrop-brightness-75\"><p></p></div></div></div></div><p data-start=\"5484\" data-end=\"5502\">Not man and woman.</p><p data-start=\"5504\" data-end=\"5528\">That’s surface thinking.</p><p data-start=\"5530\" data-end=\"5549\">Hermetic Gender is:</p><ul data-start=\"5551\" data-end=\"5636\"><li data-start=\"5551\" data-end=\"5581\"><p data-start=\"5553\" data-end=\"5581\">Initiative and receptivity</p></li><li data-start=\"5582\" data-end=\"5612\"><p data-start=\"5584\" data-end=\"5612\">Projection and integration</p></li><li data-start=\"5613\" data-end=\"5636\"><p data-start=\"5615\" data-end=\"5636\">Force and formation</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"5638\" data-end=\"5648\">In BBTTCC:</p><p data-start=\"5650\" data-end=\"5705\">Violence is projection.<br data-start=\"5673\" data-end=\"5676\">Integration is receptivity.</p><p data-start=\"5707\" data-end=\"5780\">Campaign authorship is projection.<br data-start=\"5741\" data-end=\"5744\">Echo manifestation is receptivity.</p><p data-start=\"5782\" data-end=\"5860\">Faction action is masculine principle.<br data-start=\"5820\" data-end=\"5823\">World mutation is feminine principle.</p><p data-start=\"5862\" data-end=\"5871\">One acts.</p><p data-start=\"5873\" data-end=\"5886\">One gestates.</p><p data-start=\"5888\" data-end=\"5908\">Neither is superior.</p><p data-start=\"5910\" data-end=\"5999\">You cannot raid forever without integrating.<br data-start=\"5954\" data-end=\"5957\">You cannot integrate without acting first.</p><p data-start=\"6001\" data-end=\"6048\">Creation requires both impulse and containment.</p><p data-start=\"6050\" data-end=\"6095\">Even the Great Storehouse of Images requires:</p><ul data-start=\"6097\" data-end=\"6143\"><li data-start=\"6097\" data-end=\"6118\"><p data-start=\"6099\" data-end=\"6118\">The will to build</p></li><li data-start=\"6119\" data-end=\"6143\"><p data-start=\"6121\" data-end=\"6143\">The field to receive</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"6145\" data-end=\"6182\">That is gender in the Hermetic sense.</p><p data-start=\"6184\" data-end=\"6208\">Dynamic complementarity.</p><hr data-start=\"6210\" data-end=\"6213\"><h1 data-start=\"6215\" data-end=\"6233\">The Unified View</h1><p data-start=\"6235\" data-end=\"6290\">When you look at BBTTCC through Hermetic eyes, you see:</p><ul data-start=\"6292\" data-end=\"6596\"><li data-start=\"6292\" data-end=\"6334\"><p data-start=\"6294\" data-end=\"6334\"><strong data-start=\"6294\" data-end=\"6307\">Mentalism</strong> → Narrative as structure</p></li><li data-start=\"6335\" data-end=\"6386\"><p data-start=\"6337\" data-end=\"6386\"><strong data-start=\"6337\" data-end=\"6355\">Correspondence</strong> → Subsystems echo each other</p></li><li data-start=\"6387\" data-end=\"6423\"><p data-start=\"6389\" data-end=\"6423\"><strong data-start=\"6389\" data-end=\"6402\">Vibration</strong> → No static states</p></li><li data-start=\"6424\" data-end=\"6467\"><p data-start=\"6426\" data-end=\"6467\"><strong data-start=\"6426\" data-end=\"6438\">Polarity</strong> → All tracks are gradients</p></li><li data-start=\"6468\" data-end=\"6500\"><p data-start=\"6470\" data-end=\"6500\"><strong data-start=\"6470\" data-end=\"6480\">Rhythm</strong> → Pressure cycles</p></li><li data-start=\"6501\" data-end=\"6540\"><p data-start=\"6503\" data-end=\"6540\"><strong data-start=\"6503\" data-end=\"6519\">Cause/Effect</strong> → Engine integrity</p></li><li data-start=\"6541\" data-end=\"6596\"><p data-start=\"6543\" data-end=\"6596\"><strong data-start=\"6543\" data-end=\"6553\">Gender</strong> → Action and integration interdependence</p></li></ul><p data-start=\"6598\" data-end=\"6641\">The game works because it is not arbitrary.</p><p data-start=\"6643\" data-end=\"6698\">It is metaphysical architecture disguised as mechanics.</p><hr data-start=\"6700\" data-end=\"6703\"><h1 data-start=\"6705\" data-end=\"6723\">Mal’s Final Word</h1><p data-start=\"6725\" data-end=\"6768\">You keep asking if BBTTCC is “just a game.”</p><p data-start=\"6770\" data-end=\"6779\">It isn’t.</p><p data-start=\"6781\" data-end=\"6847\">It is a ritual engine for exploring how thought becomes structure.</p><p data-start=\"6849\" data-end=\"7043\">You build hexes out of intention.<br data-start=\"6882\" data-end=\"6885\">You populate them with memory.<br data-start=\"6915\" data-end=\"6918\">You shape them with belief.<br data-start=\"6945\" data-end=\"6948\">You fracture them with ideology.<br data-start=\"6980\" data-end=\"6983\">You repair them with unity.<br data-start=\"7010\" data-end=\"7013\">You corrupt them with neglect.</p><p data-start=\"7045\" data-end=\"7067\">And the world answers.</p><p data-start=\"7069\" data-end=\"7088\">Because it is mind.</p><p data-start=\"7090\" data-end=\"7121\">And you are thinking inside it.</p>"
      },
